---

---

<section id="pricing" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">
      料金
      <span>PRICE</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="pricing-content">
      <div class="pricing-notice">
        <p>※ 当院のAGA治療は<strong>自由診療</strong>です。健康保険は適用されません。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-table">
        <div class="pricing-header">
          <span>治療内容</span>
          <span>料金（税込）</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-row">
          <div class="pricing-item">
            <span class="item-name">初診料</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pricing-price">
            <span class="price">無料</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-row">
          <div class="pricing-item">
            <span class="item-name">再診料</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pricing-price">
            <span class="price">無料</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-row highlight">
          <div class="pricing-item">
            <span class="item-name">デュタステリド</span>
            <span class="item-note">30日分</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pricing-price">
            <span class="price-main">5,500</span>
            <span class="price-unit">円</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="product-card">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img src="/dutasteride.jpg" alt="デュタステリド錠0.5mgZA「トーワ」" />
        </div>
        <div class="product-info">
          <h4 class="product-name">デュタステリド錠0.5mgZA「トーワ」</h4>
          <p class="product-description">当院で処方する医薬品です。1日1回1錠を服用します。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-notes">
        <p>※ 処方は医師の診察後となります</p>
        <p>※ 診察により最大6ヶ月分まで処方可能です</p>
        <p>※ 効果には個人差があります</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    background: var(--color-bg-section);
  }

  .pricing-content {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pricing-notice {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-highlight);
  }

  .pricing-notice p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .pricing-notice strong {
    color: var(--color-highlight);
  }

  .pricing-table {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .pricing-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .pricing-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .pricing-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .pricing-row.highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.05), rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.1));
  }

  .pricing-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .item-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .item-note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .pricing-price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .price {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .price-main {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-highlight);
  }

  .price-unit {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .product-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .product-image img {
    width: 120px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .product-name {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .product-description {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .pricing-notes {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pricing-notes p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .pricing-header {
      padding: 14px 20px;
    }

    .pricing-row {
      padding: 16px 20px;
    }

    .price-main {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .product-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .product-image img {
      width: 140px;
    }
  }
</style>
